		<label>Full protective assault armor</label>
		<description>
机翻 · 通用领域
The Golden Iris Empire developed heavy armor by combining the Galactic Power Armor technology with its own craftsmanship. \This type of armor has extremely superior protection and can be called an impregnable tower, but excessive protection also has a significant impact and burden on the wearer. \n\nThanks to the thick armor plate and built-in impact reduction design, the damage absorption coefficient is reduced to 70% when worn, and the mood slightly decreases.</description>
